        dct:description "lambda_measured_nm 2.520, eig_pearson_r 1.0, foreground 0.394 — datasets/chrysomallon_squamiferum_turing_wavelength_s0/pass1_metrics.json: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-chrysomallon-squamiferum-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 6f01b4c5e4c9fa53e8bf2c8825be8b7ccb7fba3c, application/json, 2356 B, artifact_sha256 1c8aa31f5a81fb732bfcc8bd66151bb4ec421ebf24e2b2727fe5ea215fba68ca (sha256 1c8aa31f5a81fb732bfcc8bd66151bb4ec421ebf24e2b2727fe5ea215fba68ca), spec_fingerprint e0865ee451716d4a3fa5bd6b6983a8391e5da7f8dc195fece7fe187c823b6b31" .
